{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_marks": {
        "diana_skill2": "【附加包】冲向目标，造成<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 法术强度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>；目标带<#a974ffff>月光<>时再冲一次。<#a974ffff>苍白之瀑<>（<#ffb900ff>10秒<>一次）：冲到时获得<#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% 法术强度<>的<#e8d44dff>护盾<>，三颗法球依次撞向身边的敌人，各造成<#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% 法术强度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，三颗炸完护盾再加一层。",
        "kennen_attack": "【附加包】投掷手里剑。被动 <#ff9028ff>雷缚印<>：技能命中英雄留下标记，同一人第三层<#ef5350ff>眩晕1.25秒<>（7秒内再次眩晕0.5秒）。<#ff9028ff>电刃<>：每第5次普攻额外造成<#a974ffff>48<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 法强<>魔法伤害并留下标记。",
        "kaisa_attack": "【附加包】普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>物理伤害。<#ff9028ff>体表活肤<>：普攻在英雄身上叠电浆（被控制的英雄2层），每次命中附加<#a974ffff>18+9×层数<>魔法伤害；满5层引爆，造成<#f5f5f5ff>80<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>60%<>+<#f5f5f5ff>8%最大生命<>真实伤害。<#ff9028ff>极限超载<>：每<#ffb900ff>8秒<>首次命中英雄时加速，随后<#ffb900ff>4秒<>攻速+<#ffb900ff>90%<>，9级起隐身<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_marks": {
        "diana_skill2": "【附加包】衝向目標，造成<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 魔法攻擊<>的<#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>；目標帶<#a974ffff>月光精華<>時再衝一次。<#a974ffff>蒼白月瀑<>（<#ffb900ff>10秒<>一次）：衝到時獲得<#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% 魔法攻擊<>的<#e8d44dff>護盾<>，三個星體依次撞向身邊的敵人，各造成<#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% 魔法攻擊<>的<#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>，三個炸完護盾再加一層。",
        "kennen_attack": "【附加包】投擲手裡劍。被動 <#ff9028ff>風暴印記<>：技能命中英雄留下印記，同一人第三層<#ef5350ff>暈眩1.25秒<>（7秒內再次暈眩0.5秒）。<#ff9028ff>電能釋放<>：每第5次普攻額外造成<#a974ffff>48<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 法術強度<>魔法傷害並留下印記。",
        "kaisa_attack": "【附加包】普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>物理傷害。<#ff9028ff>二階蟲甲<>：普攻在英雄身上疊電漿（被控制的英雄2層），每次命中附加<#a974ffff>18+9×層數<>魔法傷害；滿5層引爆，造成<#f5f5f5ff>80<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>60%<>+<#f5f5f5ff>8%最大生命<>真實傷害。<#ff9028ff>極速充能<>：每<#ffb900ff>8秒<>首次命中英雄時加速，隨後<#ffb900ff>4秒<>攻速+<#ffb900ff>90%<>，9級起隱身<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_marks": {
        "diana_skill2": "[Add-on] <#a974ffff>Lunar Rush<>: dash to the target for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; if the target bears <#a974ffff>Moonlight<> she dashes again at once (champions first). <#a974ffff>Pale Cascade<> (every <#ffb900ff>10s<>): on arrival a <#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and three orbs that hit nearby enemies for <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% AP<> each; after the third the shield comes again.",
        "kennen_attack": "[Add-on] Throws shurikens. Passive <#ff9028ff>Mark of the Storm<>: his abilities mark the champions they hit; the third on one champion <#ef5350ff>stuns for 1.25s<> (0.5s if stunned within 7s). <#ff9028ff>Electrical Surge<>: every fifth attack deals <#a974ffff>48<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and marks.",
        "kaisa_attack": "[Add-on] Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Second Skin<>: hits stack Plasma on that champion (2 if CC'd), each dealing <#a974ffff>18 + 9/stack<> magic damage; the 5th ruptures for <#f5f5f5ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>60% AD<> + <#f5f5f5ff>8% max health<> true damage. <#ff9028ff>Supercharge<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> her first champion hit hastes her, then <#ffb900ff>+90%<> attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<> (level 9+: <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> invisible)."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_marks": {
        "diana_skill2": "[확장] 대상에게 돌진해 <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 70%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>. 대상에게 <#a974ffff>달빛<>이 있으면 즉시 한 번 더 돌진(챔피언 우선). <#a974ffff>은빛 가호<>(<#ffb900ff>10초<>마다): <#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#e8d44dff>보호막<>, 구체 3개가 주변 적에게 각각 <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>; 3개 모두 터지면 보호막 한 번 더.",
        "kennen_attack": "[확장] 표창을 던집니다. 기본 지속 효과 <#ff9028ff>폭풍의 표식<>: 스킬이 적중한 챔피언에게 표식을 남기며, 한 챔피언의 세 번째 표식은 <#ef5350ff>1.25초 기절<>(7초 안에 다시 기절하면 0.5초). <#ff9028ff>전류 방출<>: 다섯 번째 공격마다 <#a974ffff>48<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 주문력<>의 추가 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>와 표식.",
        "kaisa_attack": "[확장] 기본 공격은 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 100%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>. <#ff9028ff>두 번째 피부<>: 맞힌 챔피언에게 플라즈마 중첩(CC 상태면 2), 적중마다 <#a974ffff>18+9×중첩<> 마법 피해; 5중첩에 폭발해 <#f5f5f5ff>80<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>60%<>+<#f5f5f5ff>최대 체력의 8%<> 고정 피해. <#ff9028ff>고속 충전<>: <#ffb900ff>8초<>마다 처음 챔피언을 맞히면 이동 속도, 이후 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 공격 속도 +<#ffb900ff>90%<>(9레벨부터 <#ffb900ff>0.5초<> 투명)."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_marks": {
        "diana_skill2": "【拡張】対象へダッシュし<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。対象に<#a974ffff>月光<>があればすぐもう一度（チャンピオン優先）。<#a974ffff>朧月の羽衣<>（<#ffb900ff>10秒<>毎）：到着時に<#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<>の<#e8d44dff>シールド<>、光の玉3つが周囲の敵に各<#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>、3つ目でシールド再展開。",
        "kennen_attack": "【拡張】手裏剣を投げる。パッシブ <#ff9028ff>嵐の刻印<>：スキルが当たったチャンピオンに刻印、同じ相手に3つ目で<#ef5350ff>1.25秒スタン<>（7秒以内の再スタンは0.5秒）。<#ff9028ff>稲妻の奔流<>：5回目の通常攻撃ごとに<#a974ffff>48<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 魔力<>の追加<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>と刻印。",
        "kaisa_attack": "【拡張】通常攻撃は<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の100%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。<#ff9028ff>ヴォイドスキン<>：相手にプラズマ（行動妨害中は2）、<#a974ffff>18+9×スタック<>の魔法ダメージ；5で炸裂し<#f5f5f5ff>80<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>60%<>+<#f5f5f5ff>最大体力の8%<>の確定ダメージ。<#ff9028ff>スーパーチャージ<>：<#ffb900ff>8秒<>ごとに初命中で加速、その後<#ffb900ff>4秒<>攻撃速度+<#ffb900ff>90%<>（Lv9から<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>透明）。"
      }
    }
  }
}
